# Vendored AI proctoring engine (libraries + model weights, ~25MB).
# Generated by `npm run fetch:proctor-assets`, which also runs on postinstall.
# Kept out of git so the repo does not carry binary blobs forever; the script
# is the reproducible source of truth and fails loudly if an upstream host is
# gone, rather than silently shipping an engine with missing models.
public/vendor/
public/models/
